    c2p: ['Second coat (general surface)', 'Rolled once the first coat has cured (3–10 h)', '2 coats 1.2 kg/m² ≈ 0.83 mm', '0.6 kg/m² (491.8 ml/m²)', 'third coat (required thickness) or the anti-slip layer, otherwise 24 h after the last coat', 'one component; Accelerator S by season'],
    c3: ['Third coat (adjusted to the required thickness)', 'Rolled once the second coat has cured (3–10 h)', '3 coats 1.8 kg/m² ≈ 1.25 mm', '0.6 kg/m² (491.8 ml/m²)', '24 h after the last coat', 'one component; Accelerator S by season'],
