    term: ['Termination (EXCEED)', 'After the film: the top edge of the upstand and every film edge sealed with {EX} — durable without a covering film', '10 × 10 mm bead', 'about 2.7 m per 320 ml cartridge (incl. 20 % loss, TDS table)', 'tack-free 5 h (23 °C) · 24 h (5 °C); full cure 3–7 days', 'one component, from the cartridge'],
    c1: ['First coat (general surface)', 'rolled or trowelled on evenly', '0.5 mm for both coats', '0.6 kg/m²', 'second coat (within the 1Day method)', 'one component; Accelerator S by season (spring/autumn 2.5, winter 5.0 wt%)'],
